# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
**/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# next.js
**/.next/
**/out/

# turbo
**/.turbo/

# production
**/build
**/dist

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.envrc

# direnv
.direnv/

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# next dev writes its own notes for agents next to the app. The rules of this
# repository are in the root AGENTS.md.
/apps/web/AGENTS.md
